{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 34,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.423583984375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The GDG reiterated that national guidelines should specify the investigations that are necessary to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        492.5778503417969,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "rule out TB disease. It noted that screening of child contacts could include testing for TBI (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        492.1238098144531,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4227905273438,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "section",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86614990234375,
        93.79071807861328,
        84.63815307617188,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "1.3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.64299774169922,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4381713867188,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": ") and CXR, although, lack of those investigations should not be a barrier for either diagnosis of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605072021484,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4210815429688,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "disease or provision of preventive treatment. In the absence of those tests, clinical assessment alone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605072021484,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3776245117188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "is sufficient to decide on initiation of TPT, particularly for household contacts aged < 5 years of a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605072021484,
        133.3907012939453,
        321.3326110839844,
        147.83375549316406
      ],
      "text": "TB. person with bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.5044555664062,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG concluded that symptom screening with or without the addition of CXR should be acceptable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95214557647705,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.406005859375,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "for individuals and programme managers. CXR could increase the confidence of health-care providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966548919677734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.4695434570312,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "that TB disease has been ruled out and reduce concern that TPT is being administered inappropriately.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965897560119629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.3872680664062,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "The GDG for the 2021 WHO guideline on TB screening reviewed the evaluations of three CAD products",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.946770668029785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.390380859375,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "used with digital CXR and concluded that CAD can be considered accurate when compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.44873046875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "human readers. The GDG therefore conditionally recommended its use for TB screening and triage",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.01869201660156,
        232.59950256347656,
        248.7377471923828
      ],
      "text": "(13) .  in individuals aged ≥ 15 years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        259.1612854003906,
        269.74224853515625,
        277.4313049316406
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.13720703125,
        95.90869140625,
        298.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.32589721679688,
        284.13720703125,
        527.4427490234375,
        298.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "presents an algorithm for testing for TBI and TPT, with separate entry points for people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.33721923828125,
        527.3903198242188,
        311.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "HIV, household contacts and other people at risk for TBI. More detailed algorithms for screening and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.26123046875,
        334.24658203125,
        324.9802551269531
      ],
      "text": "(63,64) testing for TBI are available in the two handbooks  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.2411193847656,
        527.3726806640625,
        346.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "The W4SS is recommended for testing all people with HIV at every visit to a health facility or contact",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.44110107421875,
        527.5140991210938,
        359.8841247558594
      ],
      "text": "with a health worker to ensure early detection of TB disease. Other clinical features may also be helpful",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965746879577637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.64111328125,
        527.28271484375,
        373.0841369628906
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. poor weight gain in pregnant women and lymphadenopathy). People who have exclusively",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.8412170410156,
        527.2794189453125,
        386.28424072265625
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB may have clinical manifestations that are not necessarily pulmonary and may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.0411071777344,
        527.416748046875,
        399.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "therefore require further evaluation before TB is definitively excluded. Other diseases that cause any",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.2411193847656,
        527.0881958007812,
        412.68414306640625
      ],
      "text": "of the four symptoms should be investigated in accordance with national guidelines and sound clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968905448913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.44110107421875,
        449.2146911621094,
        425.8841247558594
      ],
      "text": "practice. Individuals found not to have TB disease should then be assessed for TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        433.14508056640625,
        527.4542846679688,
        447.5881042480469
      ],
      "text": "Where CXR or interpretation of radiography is not available, the absence of any TB symptoms alone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.3450927734375,
        524.2332763671875,
        460.7881164550781
      ],
      "text": "can be considered sufficient before starting TPT. This would be the most sensitive of all the symptom-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987942695617676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.54510498046875,
        527.5875854492188,
        473.9881286621094
      ],
      "text": "based screening rules, and its negative predictive value is high in most settings. Addition of abnormal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990946769714355,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.7451171875,
        527.0980834960938,
        487.1881408691406
      ],
      "text": "CXR findings to the symptom screening rule would improve its sensitivity but also increase the logistics",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968905448913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.9450988769531,
        527.5761108398438,
        500.38812255859375
      ],
      "text": "and infrastructure required, the cost to individuals and health services, and the requirement for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.1451110839844,
        527.2828979492188,
        513.588134765625
      ],
      "text": "qualified staff or the availability of CXR with CAD. The optimal frequency of CXR in regular TB screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961132049560547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.3450927734375,
        527.3833618164062,
        526.7880859375
      ],
      "text": "of people with HIV is uncertain. Adding CXR to symptom screening at every visit would represent a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.5451049804688,
        527.4268188476562,
        539.9880981445312
      ],
      "text": "significant burden on individuals and health systems. Local authorities should define its application",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.7451171875,
        527.438720703125,
        553.1881103515625
      ],
      "text": "and frequency according to their local epidemiology, health infrastructure and resources. Either CXR",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.9451293945312,
        527.3831176757812,
        566.3881225585938
      ],
      "text": "with CAD or radiologists or other trained health-care workers must be available to interpret CXR.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.1451416015625,
        527.4179077148438,
        579.588134765625
      ],
      "text": "mWRDs may be useful when greater specificity is desirable, such as when there is limited capacity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.3450927734375,
        285.03759765625,
        592.7881469726562
      ],
      "text": "screen. for confirmatory testing after a positive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.0490112304688,
        527.3306884765625,
        614.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that screening with CXR or mWRD should not be a prerequisite or a barrier to initiating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954305648803711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.2490234375,
        527.433349609375,
        627.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "TPT in people with HIV because additional resources are required, in view of the marginal gain in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.448974609375,
        527.4007568359375,
        640.8919677734375
      ],
      "text": "negative predictive value. Conversely, in people with HIV and a low CD4 count, TB disease may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.6489868164062,
        527.5368041992188,
        654.0919799804688
      ],
      "text": "present despite a normal CXR. People with HIV who have any of the four symptoms or abnormal CXR",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986041069030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.8489990234375,
        527.41943359375,
        667.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "findings may have TB disease and should be investigated for TB and other diseases. Xpert  MTB/RIF  ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        666.0490112304688,
        269.7417907714844,
        680.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "should be used as the initial diagnostic test.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        687.7529296875,
        527.428466796875,
        702.1959228515625
      ],
      "text": "TPT should not be withheld from an asymptomatic individual at risk of infection if TBI testing and/or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        700.952880859375,
        527.3836059570312,
        715.3958740234375
      ],
      "text": "CXR is unavailable, as some people may have both risks (e.g. people with HIV who are also contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        714.1528930664062,
        484.86578369140625,
        728.5958862304688
      ],
      "text": "of people with TB), in which case the triage shown in the figure would have to be adapted.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23321533203125,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "16 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43409729003906,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.05807495117188,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06536865234375,
        801.0170288085938,
        390.6751403808594,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive treatment, second edition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
